<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Shadow Priests in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>Our set bonus going into Phase 3 is fantastic, mainly the 2-piece as it synergizes with the new toy for Shadow Priests that is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=96558/unerring-vision-of-lei-shen">
<img alt="Unerring Vision of Lei Shen" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_hunter_focusedaim.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Unerring Vision of Lei Shen</span></a>. This trinket maximizes the value of this set bonus, causing ghosts to trigger very consistently and causing DoTs to tick additional times. The 4-piece isn't much to write home about when compared to our 2-piece but it is still worth it over off-pieces.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="tier-15">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">Tier 15 - <a data-entity="item-set" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item-set=1166/regalia-of-the-exorcist">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Regalia of the Exorcist</span></a></span></h3>
